# Samurai's Katana: job select makes a 1/1 Hero and attaches the Katana to it: "Equipped creature gets +2/+2, has trample and
# haste, and is a Samurai in addition to its other types", so the Hero is a 3/3 Hero Samurai with trample and haste. Murasame,
# "Equip {5}" (CR 702.6a): with only one untapped Mox it is refused, and on turn 3 with five Moxen it moves the Katana to Bot1's
# Ornithopter (0/2 Thopter -> 2/4 Thopter Samurai, trample, haste); the Hero is a plain 1/1 Hero again.

